<title>UK: TENNIS-HINGIS WINS WOMEN'S SINGLES WIMBLEDON TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HINGIS WINS WOMEN'S SINGLES WIMBLEDON TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martina Hingis of Switzerland won the women's singles title at Wimbledon on Saturday when she beat Jana Novotna of the Czech Republic 2-6 6-3 6-3 in the final.</p>
</text>
